   209	
   210	`scripts/install.sh` requires: `bash ≥ 3.2`, `python3 ≥ 3.9`, `git`, `grep`,
   211	`sed`, `find`. No `curl | bash`. Tarball mode (`scripts/install-npm.sh`)
   212	runs a LOCAL `npm pack` — it produces only a local tarball plus a SHA-256
   213	sidecar and carries NO OIDC/Sigstore provenance; provenance attestations
   214	exist exclusively on artifacts published through `npm-publish.yml`
   215	(re-pass rc.4 t2 P1: the former wording claimed an absent supply-chain
   216	property for the local route). npm's integrity check still applies. Sidecars (§B) are
   217	NOT installed by default and require explicit opt-in (ADR-126).
